    <title>Physical Exam</title>
    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 2026-03-31; see the referring visit&apos;s Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Visual acuity</td><td>No light perception on either side</td></tr><tr><td>External examination</td><td>Dark glasses removed with his permission. Lids, lashes, and periocular skin normal; no swelling, redness, or discharge; lids close fully</td></tr><tr><td>Ocular surfaces</td><td>Quiet on both sides, with no injection, exposure, or discharge</td></tr><tr><td>Tenderness</td><td>None on gentle palpation over either eye</td></tr><tr><td>Eye pressure</td><td>Not measured: in comfortable eyes with no light perception, the reading would not change care</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

